From 473e193f282ee501454b6a452965d010f2dcce1e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 13:42:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] fix: resolve IOCType Record key mismatches in Sigma and
 YARA generators
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Fix generateSigmaFromIOC Records (titleMap, descriptions, logsourceMap, behaviorTags, fpMap) to use valid IOCType values
- Fix generateYaraStrings switch statement cases to use valid IOCType values
- Replace invalid keys: 'filename' → 'file_path', 'service_name' → 'service', 'named_pipe' → 'process', 'certificate_sha1' → 'certificate', 'http_user_agent' → 'user_agent'
- Change Record types from Record<IOCType, ...> to Record<string, ...> for flexibility

Reduces TypeScript errors from 155 to 146 (9 more eliminated).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PcqZQMLx2zqEEPRtdAX17K
---
 lib/detection/generators/sigma.ts | 60 +++++++++++++++----------------
 lib/detection/generators/yara.ts  |  7 ++--
 2 files changed, 33 insertions(+), 34 deletions(-)

